dot/issues/105572\r\n\r\n_**EditorInspector**_ tooltips seems to be affected by waccom drivers after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95044\r\nThis makes ProjectSettings, EditorSettings and Inspector tooltips disappear very fast even if you don't move the mouse.\r\nHaving a waccom driver installed seems to be enough for this to happen, as I have this issue without a pen tablet connected.\r\n\r\nDisabling the internal process of the tooltip's EditorHelpBitTooltip solves this issue.\r\nEverything is still working fine on windows. But some testing in other OS's would be appreciated.\r\n\r\nProblem:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f94f5ad1-2ee7-4212-b9a0-6f9757c8015d\r\n\r\n\r\nFixed:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ade3a4a-0a2e-44b7-8cab-d049f0a922b7\r\n\r\n\r\nPS: Feel free to close this PR if someone more knowledgeable knows how to fix this issue in a better way.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed",